{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Every  even  number  greater  than  2  can  be  expressed  as  the  sum  of  two  prime  numbers.</i>\n</p><p>Name  the  mathematician  for  which  this  theorem  was  named,  and  then  name  the  mathematician  to  whom  he  transmitted  this  theorem  via  letter  in  1742.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a79cc602448262b4a3a09a75d956aacb36b3938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) Ptolemy;  Archimedes}\\qquad \\text{(B)  Goldbach;  Newton}\\qquad \\text{(C)  Lagrange;  Goldbach}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"592\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abf358af2dea01c9f4166ab8de6d85596dfdaf64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)  Euclid;  Plato}\\qquad \\text{(E)  Goldbach;  Bernoulli}\\qquad \\text{(F)  Goldbach;  Euler}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"550\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d8a9a4c7065828d8a5faa27f6e84a44ff69d819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(G)  L&#39;Hopital;  Goldbach}\\qquad \\text{(H)  Goldbach;  L&#39;Hopital}\\qquad \\text{(I)  Ramanujan;  Fermat}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"594\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8acbf0e2c6d8f345e041356cb91b9a8fff4d7297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(J)  Fermat;  Ramanujan}\\qquad \\text{(K)  Goldbach;  Ramanujan}\\qquad \\text{(L)  Goldbach;  Fermat}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"592\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/024a3b7d6142bfaff69fde35adb2b6a23a1c8538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(M)  De  Moivre;  Cauchy}\\qquad \\text{(N)  Cauchy;  De  Moivre}\\qquad \\text{(O)  Goldbach;  Cauchy}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"576\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/379269c0acd85022e113aa022dadcab8f7fbe416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(P)  Goldbach;  Descartes}\\qquad \\text{(Q)  Goldbach;  Hilbert}\\qquad \\text{(R) none of the above}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"565\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/2346687e074095976d7ba8896b89e3a89002648e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(F) } \\text{Goldbach ; Euler}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\" /> since Goldbach's Conjecture is the theorem's name, and Goldbach wrote a letter of the theorem to Euler in 1742.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index